==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Fusion Strike|Trevenant|17}} from the {{TCG|Fusion Strike}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Trevenant}}.
*'''Rumble Stomp''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Plasma Storm|Torterra|3}} from the {{TCG|Plasma Storm}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

